降雨機率七到九成，ECMWF 算 1.2 mm 的小雨，GFS 沒雨；04:00–07:00 轉成降雨機率一成以下、雲變少，風都不大。", "basis": "Open-Meteo 格點（ECMWF、GFS，10/28 09:20 查詢）", "assessed_at": "2026-10-28T09:20+08:00"}, {"id": "confidence", "order": 5, "topic": "預報可信度", "level": "unknown", "headline": "距出發 9 天，低可信度", "detail": "兩個模式第二晚差距從昨天的快 7 °C 縮到約 4 °C，但 GFS 一天就跳了 5 °C，還在變。氣象署一週預報要等 10/31 發布那份才會涵蓋 11/6，11/2 才涵蓋到 11/8，到時候改以氣象署為主。", "basis": "氣象署一週預報（10/28 發布，到 11/3）；Open-Meteo 格點（ECMWF、GFS，10/28 09:20 查詢）", "assessed_at": "2026-10-28T09:20+08:00"}]}, "itinerary": {"rows": [{"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T10:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T10:00", "event": "起登", "place": "戒茂斯登山口", "elev_m": 1883}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T10:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T11:00", "event": "經過", "place": "戒茂斯山前峰", "elev_m": 2065}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T12:10", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T12:00", "event": "經過", "place": "戒茂斯山", "elev_m": 2510}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T15:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T16:00", "event": "抵達營地", "place": "新武呂溪營地", "elev_m": 2208}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T07:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T08:00", "event": "拔營出發", "place": "新武呂溪營地", "elev_m": 2208}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T11:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T11:00", "event": "經過", "place": "足球場營地", "elev_m": 2769}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T15:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T15:00", "event": "經過", "place": "嘉明湖妹池", "elev_m": 3150}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T15:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T16:00", "event": "抵達營地", "place": "獵寮營地", "elev_m": 3130}, {"day": "DAY 3", "time": "2026-11-08T04:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-08T04:00", "event": "拔營出發", "place": "獵寮營地", "elev_m": 3130}, {"day": "DAY 3", "time": "2026-11-08T06:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-08T06:00", "event": "日出", "place": "嘉明湖", "elev_m": 3310}, {"day": "DAY 3", "time": "2026-11-08T07:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-08T07:00", "event": "經過", "place": "三叉山", "elev_m": 3496}, {"day": "DAY 3",